CLASS:: KSAssets
summary:: SynthDefs, gate knowledge and sample buffers for EventScheduler
categories:: Scheduling
related:: Classes/EventScheduler, Classes/SynthDescLib

DESCRIPTION::
Loads compiled SynthDefs into a server and into link::Classes/SynthDescLib:: (so the controls, including code::gate::, are known), answers the gate question for auto-release, and loads sample buffers. When Klotho's assets are not loaded, the infrastructure defs the player needs (code::__busRouter::, code::__klEnvCtrl::, the width families) are built in sclang from the same source Klotho compiles them from, at the widths Klotho precompiles (1 2 4 6 8 12 16 24 32) and no others.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: klothoAssetsDir
Where Klotho's code::assets:: folder is. Default code::~/Klotho/klotho/utils/playback/supersonic/assets::.

METHOD:: new
ARGUMENT:: server

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: loadSynthDefDir
Load every code::.scsyndef:: under a directory (code::/d_loadDir::) and read its SynthDescs. Syncs when called inside a Routine.

METHOD:: loadKlothoDefs
Load code::synthdefs/{infra,instruments,effects}:: under the assets folder.

METHOD:: hasDef
METHOD:: isGated
METHOD:: missingDefs
Gate presence comes from the compiled def, then from the file's code::meta.defs[name].gate::, then "ungated".

METHOD:: samplePaths
A code::name -> path:: map for samples the file does not describe. Resolution order: the file's code::meta.samples::, this map, Klotho's bundled code::samples.json::.

METHOD:: loadSamples
METHOD:: freeSamples
METHOD:: sampleMap
